{"images":["data:image/webp;base64,"],"messages":[{"content":"The 2-Mg concrete pipe has a center of mass at point G. If it is suspended from cables AB and AC, determine the diameter of cable AB so that the average normal stress developed in this cable is the same as in the 10-mm diameter cable AC. <image>\n\n(A) 10.9 mm\n(B) 11.1 mm\n(C) 19.9 mm\n(D) 11.9 mm\n\nAnswer with the option's letter from the given choices directly.","role":"user"}]}